"P3000181528" "Defeat the base's leader"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P92201584" "That 5th Column goon was mouthy, talking about that Reichsman as the new leader of the 5th Column. Kicking him to the curb was a good start on getting some payback for being cheated out of your pay. But maybe now you should look around, to try to figure out what the bozo was talking about. Whatever it is, it can't be good for you."

