// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 0 M_Object2 :
"P314087333" "<em ReichsmanCaptured>"
// 4.5 MM :
"P3506092008" "<f=B_Boss Goto=e17><f=B_Boss em typing d=3>"
// 5 M_Object2 :
"P3366123100" "<em ReichsmanReleased>"
// 5 B_Boss :
"P1614316521" "<em d=3>Finally...<em lecture d=3>The Reichsman Returns."
// 3.5 MM :
"P141669219" "<em Welcome d=3>It is true... You have been imprisoned here."
// 5 B_Boss :
"P618960359" "<d=3>You are responsible for freeing me? How kind of you.<em yourewelcome d=3>Who are you and these others?"
// 8 MM :
"P3021650875" "<em fancybow d=5 t=5>I am Roderick Mueller, herr Reichsman, and these are some mercenaries I hired to help me.<em crossarms d=3>Now that you are free, I have a service to ask of you."
// 3.5 B_Boss :
"P2222828962" "<em laugh d=3.5>A service? I think not. I serve only the 5th Column. Instead, I shall dispose of you all!"
// 2.5 B_Boss :
"P3017524987" "<em ReichsmanAttack d=2.5>"
// 3 Caption :
"P2600150437" "<x=0.6 y=0.6 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor Khaki>After Reichsman's Fist of Tyranny attack..."
// 3 Caption :
"P405951452" "<x=0.7 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor Khaki>...you don't remember exactly what happened."
// 3 Caption :
"P1935759485" "<x=0.8 y=0.8 d=4><scale 1.75><color black><bgcolor Khaki>...You find yourself locked inside a 5th Column jail cell..."

