// Dialog :
"P24021516" "Well, that sucked! How are you supposed to get your revenge against a guy who's unstoppable?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P138027141" "While you were dancing with that super-Reichsman, I had some people look at that information you got from the 5th Column base. Man, no wonder you couldn't take out Reichsman! He's doing something to super-power himself. That's why those clowns have accepted him as their leader.<br><br>I think I know where you can find out what's makin' Reichsman so tough, and maybe how to stop it or use it to give you an edge. Let me know when you're ready to go and figure out how to end this problem.."
// RandomFameString :
"P1817135472" "Reichsman and the 5th Column are tearing up Boomtown. It's only a matter of time before they invade the Rogue Isles."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3343282844" "Whadda find out, {HeroName}? You find a line on takin' Reichsman down?"
// Answer Text :
"P3456390413" "Say that Reichsman is using a machine to boost himself."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P589740212" "Yeah? So you're gonna go destroy this machine and show that Reichsman who's the boss?"
// Answer Text :
"P2992560127" "Tell Barracuda that the machine is protected from any attack."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1604559849" "Protected from any attack by the very dimensional energies are empowering Reichsman? Man, that sucks.<br><br>So whatcha gonna do about it, {HeroName}? You gotta find a way to take down Reichsman, so we can get our payback.<br><br>Hey, it's too bad you can't just use the machine yourself, to you know, just power you and your buddies up to a level when you can beat that Reichsman clown down."
// Answer Text :
"P3542741614" "Explain that's exactly what you intend to do."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2269390322" "What? You're going to talk Lord R into having Ghost Widow, Black Scorpion, Scirocco, and my boss go along with you and then stuff them all into Reichsman's machine to empower you?!? You are crazy... or just smart. If you get results, all is good, right?<br><br>Sure, they're the most powerful dudes you can grab this side of Paragon City and they'll give you access to more power than anyone should probably have. Yeah, you know that Lord R will likely ignore exactly <color red>how</color> you beat Reichsman as long as you beat him.<br><br>It sounds like you got a solid plan, {HeroName}. I'm just glad I'm not the one caught between the Patrons of Arachnos and the Reichsman. Go kick some butt!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P543966121" "So, {HeroName}, the tech guys looked over those files you found back in that 5th Column base and came up with some bizarre theory on why Reichsman is so damned tough. They think he's working with those freaks from his home dimension to do something to supercharge him. The techies suggest you <color orange>go to Axis America and find information</color> on just exactly what these guys are up to."
// AcceptString :
"P2208853207" "Go to Axis America and find the souce of Reichman's power"
// SendOffString :
"P657173624" "If them Axis bozos are like our 5th Column chumps, they've probably stored the information on a computer in a base. You should beat up on some of their soldiers to find the base and then... well, you know what to do."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1127631013" "<color deepskyblue>Part Four: Finding the Source</color>"

