"P3548780680" "This computer has a file that discusses experiments on transferring energy from one entity to another. You think further study will yield the source of Reichsman's power -- and perhaps a way to counter it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4290262706" "Reading over the file, you come up with a plan. It's going to take some fast talking, but you're pretty sure you can talk Lord Recluse into it. After all, it's the end results that matter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1769053480" "Talk to Barracuda"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P908408061" "You need to talk to Barracuda."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P614961096" "You've gone over your plan. It's a gutsy move, planning to screw over the Arachnos Patrons. If it goes wrong, it's going to go really wrong. But if it goes right... Yeah, it should give you the edge you need to bring down Reichsman once and for all."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2780157048" "You might be too crafty for your own good, {HeroName}, but I hope it all works out. Operators with your kind of moxie ain't that common, and it would be a shame to see you get put down by Reichsman."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3038782283" "So, {HeroName}, you come to me asking for help with this Reichsman problem. Our interests align in this case; I would be very pleased to see this Reichsman taken down. What have you learned about him? Why will this time you face him be different then the last?"
// Answer Text :
"P3608842763" "Explain that Reichsman is empowering himself with dimensional energy."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1604415942" "Interesting. So Reichsman has a machine -- a machine that's suspended between the dimensions and is thus unattackable -- that's amplifying his abilities and making him more powerful than a god. This situation is intolerable. I trust you have some plan on how to deal with it?"
// Answer Text :
"P816642061" "Explain there is a way, but that you need the services of his four strongest lieutenants."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P641667491" "You require the aid of all four of my most powerful lieutenants? And that will level the playing field in your upcoming conflict?<br><br>You ask much, {HeroName}. Why should I place them under your orders?"
// Answer Text :
"P1187667733" "Explain this is the only chance of stopping Reichsman."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P3260720552" "Very well. Infiltrating Reichsman's base shall require a multi-pronged attack. I will brief Ghost Widow, Black Scorpion, Scirocco, and Captain Mako on your plan, and then dispatch them to different locations to weaken Reichsman's forces. They are more than capable of making their own entrance into the 5th Column base, but <color orange>it is your responsbility to find them and direct them as to their part in your plan.</color> <br><br> I trust that with their help you'll be able to deal with this Reichsman situation once and for all.<br><br>I look forward to hearing how it all comes out."
// Page ReturnIntro Text :
"P2171632618" "Your treachery against my lieutenants has not gone unnoticed, {HeroName}. While they may hold a grudge against you for your actions, you fufilled your promise and removed Reichsman from the playing board. Your revenge against him for his betrayal of you aligned nicely with my desire to see him neutralized as a problem. I thank you for your efforts in this matter."
// Answer Text :
"P3856609257" "You aren't mad about our attacking your lieutenants?"
// Answer Text :
"P1704961353" "What about the empowerment machine?"
// Answer Text :
"P181400535" "So that's it then?!"
// Page ReturnPage2 Text :
"P209908996" "Mad? Hardly. You used the tools at hand to accomplish your task. I knew the only way you could possibly defeat Reichsman was to increase your own power, and I suspect that precisely why you needed the services of Ghost Widow, Black Scorpion, Scirocco, and Captain Mako. You chose a dangerous path when you seemingly betrayed them, but your ruthlessness paid off and you were successful."
// Answer Text :
"P1497289008" "So that's it then?"
// Page ReturnPage3 Text :
"P1441033783" "Do not retain any ideas of revisiting the empowerment machine and using it again. With Reichsman defeated, its defenses were trival to overcome. I have had it dismantled and the parts... destroyed. And thus, I removed temptation from the world. A device of that magnitude is too attractive to some minds; some would find it just too tempting to try to use it and increase their power to a point where they might rival me... and that cannot be allowed."
// Page ReturnReward Text :
"P1208253045" "Not quite. There is the matter of your involvement in this whole affair. You were betrayed while executing on a contract, and you took steps to see that your betrayer paid the price for such behavior. You used all necessary means to accomplish that goal, no matter the cost.<br><br>I am most pleased with your drive and your audacity, {HeroName}. You remind me of someone I knew, long ago. And I firmly believe that audacious actions -- when successful -- should be rewarded.<br><br><color orange>You may now claim to be one of my Arbiters, as a sign of my approval of your actions.</color> But know, I will be looking to you for any future audacious tasks that may arise."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1414757689" "OK, {HeroName}, it sounds like you got all of your ducks in a row. <color orange>Go and talk to Lord Recluse and talk him into giving you the help you need.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1996657136" "Go talk to Recluse"
// SendOffString :
"P1378468910" "I know you're gonna take down that Reichsman and get some payback for the way he jacked us over. Go do it, {HeroName}!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2809893551" "<color deepskyblue>Part Finale: Finishing It Off.</color>"

