"P423605788" "You were getting too big for your britches, {HeroName}. Now I get to knock you down to size."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3805042844" "You hit pretty hard... for a backstabber!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
