"P120953662" "You require my presence to help defeat Reichsman, {HeroName}. This I know. However, I cannot bring myself to help you fight your way to our destination when I know what the outcome shall be once we arrive."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - SayOnArrival 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SayOnArrival :
"P2238286657" "My defeat in this instance will advance the cause of Arachnos, I know, but I cannot stand by and let you defeat me. Such is not in my nature."

