"P4269289021" "You cannot destroy me, {HeroName}. Others have tried; all have failed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P901542017" "Though you defend Arachnos with this action, do not think that I shall not seek my revenge for this attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
